@startuml Manifest Status

title Manifest Status

state "Created" as Created : The manifest has been created but not populated completely.
state "Proposed" as Proposed : Requesting approval for the manifest.
state "Rejected" as Rejected : The manifest has been rejected.
state "Approved" as Approved : The manifest has been approved by Ground Officers.
state "Preparing" as Preparing : Volunteers are preparing the boxes for transit.
state "Ready" as Ready : The manifest is ready for collection.
state "In Transit" as InTransit : The manifest is on a convoy.
state "Delivered" as Delivered : The manifest has arrived at the ultimate destination.
state "Lost" as Lost : The manifest has been lost during transit.
state "Returned" as Returned : The manifest has been returned by the destination.

[*] --> Created
Created --> Proposed
Created --> Rejected
Proposed <-- Rejected
Rejected <-- Proposed
Proposed --> Approved
Approved --> Preparing
Preparing --> Ready
Ready --> InTransit
InTransit --> Delivered
InTransit --> Lost
Delivered <-- Returned
Lost --> [*]
Returned --> [*]
Delivered --> [*]

Rejected --> [*]

@enduml